cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Crawlora Streaming Fragmentation Index: where the most-popular US titles stream"
abstract: >-
  Per-title streaming availability for the 100 most-popular US titles and a ~5,000-title
  cross-section (June 2026): which subscription services carry each title, exclusivity,
  monetization (subscription / ads / rent-buy / cinema), and the number of subscriptions
  (and dollars) needed to watch the popular catalog. Content is scattered across dozens of
  services and most popular titles are exclusive to a single service.
type: dataset
authors:
